  "assembly_notes": "Three independent structural slots plus the support multiplicity over one tube-framed deck. top_style owns the deck family and exports the under-deck interface; support_style consumes only that interface and reports its foot positions to foot_style. All 4x4x3 = 48 combinations build without a gate. Every fold axis is solved by mate_axes and registered with register_interface_mate, supports ride deck-side hinge pins on bracket cheeks, and the telescoping inner sections stay engaged inside their outer tubes over the whole travel.",
